<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's BFE cuts prime to 10.75 pct.</title>
<headline>Portugal's BFE cuts prime to 10.75 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's Banco de Fomento &amp; Exterior said it was cutting its prime lending rate by 0.25 of a percent point to 10.75 percent, effective Thursday.</p>
<p>BFE's Banco Borges &amp; Irmao also cut its prime rate by the same amount to 10.75 percent.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
